response:
UAC-0098 conducted a phishing campaign distributing password-protected ZIP archives masquerading as the State Tax Service of Ukraine. The archives contained a malicious DOCX document exploiting CVE-2022-30190 (Follina) to download an HTML file and execute Cobalt Strike Beacon (ked.dll).

